{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03133","headline":"饯王尚书出边 · 张九龄","name":"饯王尚书出边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉相推人杰，殷宗伐鬼方。\n还闻出将重，坐见即戎良。\n上策应爲豫，中权且用光。\n令申兵气倍，威憺虏魂亡。\n树比公孙大，城如道济长。\n夏云登陇首，秋露泫辽阳。\n武德舒宸睠，文思饯乐章。\n感恩身既许，激节胆犹尝。\n祖帐倾朝列，军麾驻道傍。\n诗人何所咏，尚父欲鹰扬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}